# The captured ALL comparison rejects a left row on FALSE or UNKNOWN.
AntiJoinNotIn<p0 a0 a1>(Input<t0>,Input<t1>)|AntiJoin<NotTrue(p0) a2 a3>(Input<t2>,Input<t3>)|t2 := t0;t3 := t1;a2 := a0;a3 := a1
